 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ per step for scoring and splitting, where $N$ is the number of splats. The splitting operation involves matrix multiplications and tensor concatenations, which are efficient on GPUs [S1, unofficial].
-- **Memory Complexity:** Increases by $N_{split}$ splats per step. The maximum increase is bounded by $\min(N/10, 5000)$ per step [S1, unofficial].
